msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，提供核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力。支持Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法，并针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors. It provides kernel autotune, operator compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Atlas A2 products, Atlas A3 products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT products. It is compatible with core Triton syntax and is extensively optimized for Ascend NPU features. These optimizations include automatic parsing of kernel parameters, optimization of memory access logic, and enhancement of secure deployment mechanisms, and so on."

msgid "本指南指导开发者在**Ubuntu**环境下安装**Triton-Ascend**，涵盖快速安装、源码安装及镜像安装三种方式，并包含环境验证与常见问题排查。"
msgstr "This guide provides instructions for installing **Triton-Ascend** in an **Ubuntu** environment. It covers three methods: quick installation, source code installation, and image installation. It also includes environment verification and troubleshooting common issues."

msgid "环境准备"
msgstr "Environment Preparation"

msgid "**硬件要求**"
msgstr "**Hardware Requirements**"

msgid "Ascend产品：支持Atlas A2系列产品、Atlas A3系列产品、Ascend 950PR&950DT系列产品。"
msgstr "Ascend products: Atlas A2 products, Atlas A3 products, and Ascend 950PR&950DT products are supported."

msgid "NPU配置：建议单卡32GB及以上内存。"
msgstr "NPU configuration: We recommend a single device with 32 GB or more of memory."

msgid "操作系统：需Linux系统，具体请参考[兼容性查询助手](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)。"
msgstr "Operating system: A Linux system is required. For details, refer to [Compatibility Query Assistant](https://www.hiascend.com/hardware/compatibility)."

msgid "**软件依赖**"
msgstr "**Software Dependencies**"

msgid "确定CANN、Python和TorchNPU软件版本并安装。如需具体安装步骤，请参考昇腾社区官网《[CANN快速安装](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download)》完成驱动与固件安装。"
msgstr "Determine the software versions of CANN, Python, and TorchNPU, and install them. For specific installation steps, refer to [CANN Quick Installation](https://www.hiascend.com/cann/download) on the Ascend community website to install the driver and firmware."

msgid "CANN版本：9.2.0"
msgstr "CANN version: 9.2.0"

msgid "Python版本：3.11"
msgstr "Python version: 3.11"

msgid "TorchNPU版本：2.10.0.post7"
msgstr "TorchNPU version: 2.10.0.post7"

msgid "注：更多配套关系请参考[版本说明表](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)。"
msgstr "Note: For more compatibility information, refer to the [version compatibility matrix](./release_note.md#version-compatibility-matrix)."

msgid "快速安装"
msgstr "Quick Installation"

msgid "<a id=\"install-from-source\"></a>"
msgstr "<a id=\"install-from-source\"></a>"

msgid "<a id=\"install-from-source\">"
msgstr "<a id=\"install-from-source\">"

msgid "</a>"
msgstr "</a>"

msgid "源码安装"
msgstr "Source Code Installation"

msgid "安装依赖"
msgstr "Install dependencies"

msgid "编译Triton-Ascend"
msgstr "Compiling Triton-Ascend"

msgid "自定义LLVM构建（可选）"
msgstr "Custom LLVM Build (Optional)"

msgid "如需自定义构建LLVM，可执行以下步骤编译Triton-Ascend。"
msgstr "If you need to customize the LLVM build, perform the following steps to compile Triton-Ascend."

msgid "**代码准备**：通过`git checkout`检出指定版本的LLVM源码并应用补丁。"
msgstr "**Code preparation**: Use `git checkout` to check out the specified version of the LLVM source code and apply the patch."

msgid "**构建LLVM**：路径`/path/llvm-install`为用户规划的LLVM安装路径，需根据实际调整；路径`{PATH_TO}`为第一步中检出LLVM源码的路径。"
msgstr "**Building LLVM**: The path `/path/llvm-install` is your planned LLVM installation path. Adjust it based on your actual conditions. The path `{PATH_TO}` is the path where you checked out the LLVM source code in step 1."

msgid "**编译Triton-Ascend**：通过配置LLVM路径定位依赖库，启用ccache加速编译，并关闭Proton和单元测试来减少构建开销。"
msgstr "**Compiling Triton-Ascend**: Configure the LLVM path to locate dependency libraries, enable ccache to accelerate compilation, and disable Proton and unit tests to reduce build overhead."

msgid "**表1**源码编译参数说明表"
msgstr "**Table 1** Description of source code compilation parameters"

msgid "参数（环境变量）"
msgstr "Parameters (environment variables)"

msgid "默认值"
msgstr "Default value"

msgid "说明"
msgstr "Description"

msgid "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"
msgstr "`LLVM_SYSPATH`"

msgid "None"
msgstr "None"

msgid "指定本地已编译好的 LLVM 安装路径。设置后不再下载 LLVM 预编译包，离线构建时必填，即上文构建 LLVM 步骤中的 `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}`。"
msgstr "Specify the installation path of the locally compiled LLVM. After you set this option, the pre-compiled LLVM package is not downloaded. This option is required for offline builds, that is, the `${LLVM_INSTALL_PREFIX}` in the preceding LLVM build steps."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CLANG_LLD`"

msgid "true"
msgstr "true"

msgid "使用 clang/clang++ 作为编译器、lld 作为链接器，需提前安装 clang>=15、lld>=15。"
msgstr "To use clang/clang++ as the compiler and lld as the linker, install clang>=15 and lld>=15 in advance."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_WITH_CCACHE`"

msgid "启用 ccache 缓存编译结果，加速重复构建，需提前安装 ccache。"
msgstr "Enable ccache to cache compilation results and speed up repeated builds. Install ccache in advance."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_PROTON`"

msgid "OFF"
msgstr "OFF"

msgid "是否构建 Proton 性能分析器（profiler）。需要时设为 `ON`。"
msgstr "Specify whether to build the Proton profiler. Set it to `ON` if needed."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_TD`"

msgid "是否构建 TD（Triton-distributed-ascend）相关组件，默认关闭。"
msgstr "Whether to build TD (Triton-distributed-ascend) related components. Disabled by default."

msgid "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"
msgstr "`TRITON_BUILD_NPUIR`"

msgid "是否在安装过程中同步编译 AscendNPU-IR。设为 `ON` 时会触发 `build_npuir.py` 流程；AscendNPU-IR编译依赖CANN，需source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh（以root用户默认安装路径为例）且可用磁盘大于30GB。"
msgstr "Whether to compile AscendNPU-IR during the installation. When set to `ON`, the `build_npuir.py` process is triggered. AscendNPU-IR compilation depends on CANN. You need to source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh (using the default installation path of the root user as an example), and the available disk space must be greater than 30 GB."

msgid "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"
msgstr "`TRITON_WHEEL_NAME`"

msgid "triton_ascend"
msgstr "triton_ascend"

msgid "生成的 wheel 包名称，一般无需修改。"
msgstr "You generally do not need to modify the name of the generated wheel package."

msgid "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_APPEND_CMAKE_ARGS`"

msgid "追加透传给 CMake 的参数，多个参数用空格分隔。例如追加 `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` 可关闭单元测试构建。"
msgstr "Append parameters passed through to CMake, and separate multiple parameters with spaces. For example, appending `-DTRITON_BUILD_UT=OFF` disables unit test compilation."

msgid "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"
msgstr "`TRITON_OFFLINE_BUILD`"

msgid "设为 `ON` 后禁止构建过程中访问网络下载依赖（会自动关闭需联网拉取 googletest 的单元测试构建），用于离线环境。"
msgstr "When set to `ON`, it prevents network access during the build process to download dependencies (automatically disabling unit test builds that require fetching googletest online) and is used for offline environments."

msgid "`MAX_JOBS`"
msgstr "`MAX_JOBS`"

msgid "2 × CPU core"
msgstr "2 × CPU core"

msgid "编译并行任务数。内存紧张时可调小，例如 `export MAX_JOBS=8`。"
msgstr "The number of parallel compilation tasks. Decrease the value when memory is tight, for example, `export MAX_JOBS=8`."

msgid "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"
msgstr "`TRITON_PARALLEL_LINK_JOBS`"

msgid "并行链接任务数。链接阶段占用内存较大，内存不足时可设为 `1`。"
msgstr "The number of parallel linking tasks. The linking phase consumes a large amount of memory. If memory is insufficient, set it to `1`."

msgid "`IS_MANYLINUX`"
msgstr "`IS_MANYLINUX`"

msgid "设为 `ON` 后构建生成的 wheel 包为 manylinux 兼容格式，用于在不同 Linux 发行版上安装。"
msgstr "If you set this to `ON`, the built wheel package is in a manylinux compatible format for installation on different Linux distributions."

msgid "**(可选)Triton-distributed-ascend**：若使用[Triton-distributed-ascend](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/Triton-distributed-ascend)的功能，需源码编译shmem v1.7.0组件。"
msgstr "**(Optional) Triton-distributed-ascend**: If you use the features of [Triton-distributed-ascend](https://gitcode.com/Ascend/Triton-distributed-ascend), you need to compile the shmem v1.7.0 component from source."

msgid "4.1 获取源码："
msgstr "4.1 Obtain the source code:"

msgid "4.2 源码编译："
msgstr "4.2 Source code compilation:"

msgid "参见 [shmem项目](https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem) README.md中 \"安装\"->\"方式三： 源码编译\" 章节。"
msgstr "Refer to the \"Installation\" -> \"Method 3: Compile from Source\" section in the README.md of the [shmem project](https://gitcode.com/cann/shmem)."

