msgstr "If you need to run all test cases and print the test process information, refer to the following related commands:"

msgid "安装常见问题"
msgstr "Installation FAQ"

msgid "**问题一：安装TorchNPU时出现报错“ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu”**"
msgstr "**Problem 1: An error occurs when installing TorchNPU: \"ERROR: No matching distribution found for torch==2.7.1+cpu\"**"

msgid "**解决措施**"
msgstr "**Solutions**"

msgid "可以尝试手动安装torch后再安装TorchNPU："
msgstr "Try manually installing torch before installing TorchNPU:"

msgid "**问题二：编译安装Triton-Ascend时，如果GCC < 9.4.0，可能报错“ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs”**"
msgstr "**Problem 2: When compiling and installing Triton-Ascend, if GCC < 9.4.0, the error \"ld.lld: error: unable to find library -lstdc++fs\" may occur**"

msgid "一般是链接器无法找到stdc++fs库引起的报错。该库用于支持GCC 9之前版本的文件系统特性。此时需要手动把CMake文件中以下相关代码片段的注释打开。 文件路径：triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"
msgstr "Generally, this error occurs because the linker cannot find the stdc++fs library. This library supports file system features in GCC versions earlier than 9. In this case, manually uncomment the following related code snippet in the CMake file. File path: triton-ascend/CMakeLists.txt"

msgid "**问题三：执行算子时报错“ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package”**"
msgstr "**Problem 3: An error occurs when running an operator: \"ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'triton._C.libtriton.ascend'; 'triton._C.libtriton' is not a package\"**"

msgid "**根因分析**"
msgstr "**Root Cause Analysis**"

msgid "triton-ascend目录被triton覆盖，导致triton-ascend功能受损。"
msgstr "triton overwrites the triton-ascend directory, impairing the triton-ascend functionality."

msgid "卸载已损坏的triton-ascend，重新安装即可。以3.2.1版本为例，可执行如下命令修复："
msgstr "Uninstall the corrupted triton-ascend and reinstall it. Using version 3.2.1 as an example, run the following commands to fix it:"

msgid "**问题四：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本为何新增依赖triton？**"
msgstr "**Question 4: Why does Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 add the triton dependency?**"

msgid "答复：Triton-Ascend是基于Triton进行的二次开发，与Triton安装目录同名。若用户安装Triton-Ascend之后，再次安装Triton或依赖Triton的三方件，会覆盖Triton目录，导致Triton-Ascend功能受损。 因此通过增加Triton依赖，当Triton被覆盖安装时会有如下提醒。"
msgstr "Answer: Triton-Ascend is secondary development based on Triton, and it has the same name as the Triton installation directory. If you install Triton or third-party components that depend on Triton after installing Triton-Ascend, this action overwrites the Triton directory and impairs Triton-Ascend functionality. Therefore, by adding the Triton dependency, the following reminder is displayed when Triton is overwritten."

msgid "若用户遇到且想恢复Triton-Ascend功能，可根据问题三的解决措施进行命令修复。"
msgstr "If you encounter this issue and want to restore the Triton-Ascend functionality, perform a command repair based on the solution in question 3."

msgid "**问题五：Triton-Ascend 3.2.1版本依赖的Triton版本为何不一致？**"
msgstr "**Question 5: Why is the Triton version that Triton-Ascend 3.2.1 depends on inconsistent?**"

msgid "答复：x86与Arm使用不同版本的社区Triton安装包，是因为社区从Triton 3.2版本开始提供x86安装包，而Arm安装包是从Triton 3.5版本开始提供的。"
msgstr "Answer: x86 and Arm use different versions of the community Triton installation packages. This is because the community started providing x86 installation packages in Triton 3.2, and Arm installation packages were introduced in Triton 3.5."

msgid "**问题六：如何确认芯片类型？**"
msgstr "**Question 6: How do you confirm the chip type?**"

msgid "可以使用npu-smi命令查看系统上的NPU型号。例如，在npu-smi info命令的输出中，“910B4”对应芯片类型Atlas A2系列产品："
msgstr "Use the npu-smi command to check the NPU model on the system. For example, in the output of the npu-smi info command, \"910B4\" corresponds to the chip type of Atlas A2 products:"